        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hershel Greene, Carl Grimes, Rick Grimes, Otis, Scott Wilson, Chandler Riggs\n- Works: The Walking Dead comic book, The Walking Dead television series, The Walking Dead game series\n- Organizations: AMC\n- Concepts: fictional characters, portrayal, moral center\n\nFacts:\n- Hershel Greene is a fictional character in The Walking Dead comic book, television series, and game series.\n- Scott Wilson portrayed Hershel Greene in The Walking Dead television series.\n- In both The Walking Dead comics and television series, Hershel Greene is first introduced saving Carl Grimes after Otis shoots him.\n- Carl Grimes is the son of Rick Grimes in The Walking Dead.\n- In both The Walking Dead comics and television series, Hershel Greene becomes the moral center of the group.\n- Carl Grimes is a fictional character in The Walking Dead comic book series.\n- Chandler Riggs portrayed Carl Grimes in the American television series The Walking Dead.\n- AMC airs the American television series The Walking Dead in the United States.",
